# the hazard check kills on the first sub-pixel of the fall, so the very
# first frame without ground is already death: the 6 coyote frames
# (tuning.player.coyote_frames, testbed replays qa_coyote_*) never apply over
# water, only over pits.
# Steps: Brunnwinkl relaxed opening (Mozartkugel, boulder, walker stomp),
# then walk right off the forest path into the mill race (cols 43-44). Resi's
# hitbox leaves the last path tile in step 913 and she dies in that same
# step at y 210 (feet exactly on the water's top edge, not sunk in at all).
# JUMP pressed in step 914 (the 2nd coyote frame) never gets a chance.
# Expected: step 913 is the first airborne coyote frame, the press at 914
# jumps, she clears the 2-tile race and walks on (x >= 730, no death).
# Actual: Died at 913 (DeathCause::Hazard), lives 2.
